## Results

The Windows virtual machine was reviewed and hardened using built-in security tools. The lab improved my understanding of endpoint protection, account management, logging, firewall configuration, system updates, and least-privilege access.

## Security Recommendations

- Keep Windows and installed applications updated
- Use strong, unique passwords
- Enable multifactor authentication where available
- Avoid using an administrator account for routine activities
- Keep Microsoft Defender and the firewall enabled
- Review event logs regularly
- Remove unused accounts and applications
- Back up important files
- Use disk encryption when appropriate

